      "created_at": "2021-01-02T19:43:46Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-01-02T19:43:46Z",
      "body": "Would it be better to have a feature (as in Zoom) where they can temporarily unmute by holding down the space bar? Basically a push-to-talk (PTT). Then when they are done, releasing the space bar is all that needs to be done.\r\n",
