      "updated_at": "2021-01-03T17:01:00Z",
      "body": "As I've stated in the problem description above, I am not asking for a force-unmute feature. I'm asking about the ability to send an obvious UI prompt to the participant, right in the center of the screen, that offers them to easily unmute with the message (and button) suggested above. That's a completely different approach which is not a danger to privacy, because they can always decline, it's a conscious action.",
